wwwroot/dist/
wwwroot/node_modules/

# Logs
*.log

# Others
*.dbmdl
*.bak
*.backup
*.swp
*.tmp
*.temp

# Azure
*.azure*

# npm packages
node_modules/

# VS Code
.vscode/
